        "id": 1881060
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-21T23:21:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know the public usage of this.\nIn previous patchset I saw some method were system only and some were public, hence my comment.\n\nIf this is done for public usage in mind (like companion app for any headset bran) and not simply OEM (like socket offload), then public API should be good. If this is only intended for system usage, then system.",
      "parentUuid": "17f3c50a_7d4dedd8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 38,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 38,
        "endChar": 42
      },
      "revId": "8525459eb570c69a5df1db9227d90760cc213fb4",
